# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cluster — root environment guide (MAINNET ONLY)
#
# Cluster is a Turborepo (npm workspaces). Env vars live per-app, NOT at the root:
#   • API  → copy apps/api/.env.example  to apps/api/.env
#   • Web  → copy apps/web/.env.example  to apps/web/.env.local
#
# ⚠️ Mainnet = real funds. Never commit a populated .env. CI requires NONE of these
#    values: lint, typecheck, and build run without secrets, and tests use mocks
#    (they never hit mainnet RPC/Horizon or Supabase).
#
# Quick start:
#   cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
